    "html": "<p>Two point charges are separated by a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. The force acting between the charges is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>. The distance between the point charges is changed so that the force acting between them becomes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4F\"></span>. What is the new distance between the charges?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{4}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{d}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2d\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4d\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
